@startuml
title WIM – Diagramme de classes

skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #ffffff
  ArrowColor #555555
  BorderColor #555555
}
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #F5F7FF
skinparam noteBorderColor #6B7280
hide circle

enum Role {
  USER
  POWER_USER
  ADMIN
}

class User {
  +userId: int
  +email: string
  +role: Role
  +tokenVersion: int
  +currency: char(3)
  +emailReminders: bool
  +weeklyDigest: bool
  +stripeCustomerId: string
  +stripeSubscriptionId: string
}

class Article {
  +articleId: int
  +articleNom: varchar(100)
  +articleModele: varchar(100)
  +articleDescription: varchar(255)
  +serialNumber: varchar(120)
  +brand: varchar(120)
  +purchasePrice: decimal(12,2)
  +depreciationRate: decimal(5,2)
  +sharedWithPowerUsers: bool
  +deletedAt: datetime
}

class Garantie {
  +garantieId: int
  +garantieNom: varchar(100)
  +garantieDateAchat: date
  +garantieDuration: int  ' mois
  +garantieFin: date
  +garantieIsValide: bool
  +claimStatus: ClaimStatus
  +providerName: varchar(120)
  +providerPhone: varchar(40)
  +providerUrl: varchar(2048)
}

class Alerte {
  +alerteId: int
  +alerteNom: varchar(100)
  +alerteDate: date
  +status: AlerteStatus
  +kind: AlerteKind
  +recurrenceMonths: int
  +snoozedUntil: datetime
}

class Attachment {
  +attachmentId: int
  +type: AttachmentType
  +fileName: varchar(255)
  +mimeType: varchar(100)
  +fileUrl: varchar(500)
  +thumbUrl: varchar(500)
}

class Location {
  +locationId: int
  +name: varchar(120)
  +description: varchar(255)
}

class Tag {
  +tagId: int
  +name: varchar(40)
}

class ArticleNote {
  +noteId: int
  +content: varchar(2000)
  +kind: ArticleNoteKind
}

class SavedView {
  +id: int
  +name: varchar(60)
  +query: varchar(500)
}

class InventoryShare {
  +inventoryShareId: int
  +permission: SharePermission
  +active: bool
}

class ShareInvite {
  +shareInviteId: int
  +email: varchar(255)
  +token: varchar(128)
  +status: InviteStatus
  +permission: SharePermission
  +expiresAt: datetime
}

class AuditLog {
  +id: int
  +action: varchar(80)
  +entity: varchar(80)
  +entityId: int
  +createdAt: datetime
}

' Possession (tout est rattaché à un User propriétaire)
User "1" --> "0..*" Article : possède
User "1" --> "0..*" Location : possède
User "1" --> "0..*" Tag : possède
User "1" --> "0..*" SavedView : possède
User "1" --> "0..*" AuditLog : trace

' Articles et leurs entités liées
Article "1" o-- "0..1" Garantie : possède
Article "1" o-- "0..*" Attachment : pièces
Article "1" o-- "0..*" Alerte : déclenche
Article "1" o-- "0..*" ArticleNote : historique
Garantie "1" o-- "0..3" Alerte : génère (J-30/J-7/J-1)
Garantie "1" o-- "0..*" Attachment : preuves

' Relations M:N via tables de jonction
Article "0..*" -- "0..*" Location : ArticleLocation
Article "0..*" -- "0..*" Tag : ArticleTag

' Partage entre utilisateurs
User "1" --> "0..*" ShareInvite : émet
User "1" --> "0..*" InventoryShare : partage (owner -> target)

note bottom
Hypothèses (alignées sur prisma/schema.prisma) :
- Une Garantie appartient à 0..1 Article (lien unique).
- Les noms français legacy (Alerte*, Garantie, articleNom...) sont
  intentionnellement conservés ; les unions @wim/types sont anglaises
  (AlertStatus) mais les valeurs littérales coïncident.
- Enums : Role, ClaimStatus, AlerteStatus, AlerteKind, AttachmentType,
  ArticleNoteKind, SharePermission, InviteStatus.
end note
@enduml
